{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body><p>\n\t\t\t亞太經合組織第三十三次領導人非正式會議在深圳舉行。國家主席習近平主持會議，並發表重要講話。<br/>\n<br/>\n習近平表示，中方願同各方一道集思廣益、匯聚合力，攜手搭建亞太共同體的「四樑八柱」，並宣布中方將提供二千萬美元，資助開展APEC務實合作。\t\t</p>\n<ul><li>主頁</li></ul></body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-19T04:43:52.179438+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":117,"images":0,"source":"RTHK 本地","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-19T03:21:08+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-19T07:17:33.121935+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-19T04:37:26.793335+00:00","content_hash":"ce88fc0cdec818cb7e08a2979bdbf33cc8da650442ed85ff3e83b2aeebb43d67","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}